#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
pv_fullsnap_universal_v62_backend_ready.py

V62 BACKEND-READY single-file common-flow runner.
Based on V61. Added: process_image_for_backend() API entrypoint,
_BACKEND_RESULT_PANELS global collector. No line-snap algorithm changes.

This version removes the _ENGINE_V34_LINES/_ENGINE_V42_LINES string embedding,
engine materialization, and subprocess calls. The common outer flow is shared:
load route metrics -> choose route -> call only the route-specific full line-snap
body -> verify standard outputs.

Important: the blue-rail / magenta-row line-snap logic from v34/v42 is not
simplified. It is moved into real Python function bodies, not stored as strings
or encoded payloads.
"""
